2026-09-24T00:30:46.0504673Z   mirror: |
2026-09-24T00:30:46.0505022Z     SSTATE_MIRRORS = "file://.* http://sstate.yoctoproject.org/all/PATH;downloadfilename=PATH"
2026-09-24T00:30:46.0505471Z   ccache: |
